{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>發佈時間：12:59 2026-09-02 HKT</p>\n\n<p>觀塘駿業街60號駿運工業大廈，今（2日）早上11時36分，一名年約70多歲男子，在上址一貨倉單位內燒炭自殺，家人發現報警求助，救護員接報到場，經檢驗後證實事主當場氣絕身亡。</p>\n<p>現場消息稱，上址貨倉是死者的友人所有，死者早前向友人表示借貨倉用，未幾發生燒炭事件。警方在現場發現遺書，有人透露因生活問題不如意而尋死。</p>\n<img alt=\"警員到場調查。梁國峰攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/2e16d47d16f68fe221d6808b0e7330d5/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-02_at_12_59_42_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"男子在工廈單位內燒炭自殺亡。梁國峰攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/3235a0303321b8841065a10eed027b9a/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-02_at_12_39_02.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/a8e0ffd0599b8c48eee7216e11b93187/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-02_at_12_39_01_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/8a96a070dfd5e106da8ee081da140bfd/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-02_at_12_59_43.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"警員到場調查。梁國峰攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/fcaa4fc9d080053844572044d6fab309/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-02_at_12_39_01.jpeg\"/>\n<p></p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-02T05:44:03.369121+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":181,"images":5,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}